<title>SINGAPORE: India to unveil model oil production contract Aug.</title>
<headline>India to unveil model oil production contract Aug.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>India's Ministry of Petroleum and Natural Gas is planning to unveil its new model production sharing contract (PSC) next month, Minister T.R. Baalu said on Friday.</p>
<p>On a roadshow to promote the government's New Exploration Licensing Policy (NELP), Baalu said the contract for the 31 offshore blocks it is currently offering, will be ready sometime in August.</p>
<p>--Singapore Newsroom (+65-870-3086)</p>
